<head>
    <title>FAQ</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="faq.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include("partials/header.ejs") %>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h1>
        
        <h2 class="faq-question">1. What does your website offer?</h2>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <p>Our website provides users with tools to calculate their daily calorie needs based on their individual factors such as age, gender, weight, height, and activity level. 
                Additionally, we offer personalized meal plans tailored to help users achieve their health and fitness goals.</p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="faq-question">2. How does the calorie calculator work?</h2>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <p>Our calorie calculator utilizes scientifically validated formulas to estimate your Basal Metabolic Rate (BMR) and Total Daily Energy Expenditure (TDEE).
                    By inputting your personal information and activity level, the calculator determines how many calories you need to maintain, gain, or lose weight.</p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="faq-question">3. Are the meal plans customizable?</h2>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <p>Sadly, our meals are not customizable (yet).</p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="faq-question">4. Can I track my progress using your website</h2>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <p>Absolutely! Users have access to tools for tracking their progress including weight, measurements, and adherence to their meal plans. 
                We also provide features to adjust meal plans as progress is made towards health and fitness goals.</p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="faq-question">5. Is there customer support available if I encounter any issues or have questions?</h2>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <p>Absolutely! We have a dedicated customer support team available to assist users with any inquiries, technical issues, or feedback they may have. 
                Feel free to reach out to us via email or through our website's contact form, and we'll be happy to assist you.</p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="faq-question">6. Is my personal information secure on your website?</h2>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <p>We take the privacy and security of our users' personal information very seriously. 
                Our website does not need to employ industry-standard security measures to protect user data and adheres to strict privacy policies, because we simply do not store your data.
                We do not share it with third parties without your consent.</p>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div id="space"></div>

    <%- include("partials/footer.ejs") %>
</body>